      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "scene_setup"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T03",
      "speaker_id": "C",
      "text_en": "But the recordings vary greatly in quality.",
      "meaning_vi": "A: Đề tài đo tiếp xúc tiếng ồn khi đi học; bản ghi điện thoại khác chất lượng.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "scene_setup"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T04",
      "speaker_id": "B",
      "text_en": "I ranked the noisiest trips before checking the phones. Some automatically boosted quiet sounds, while others did not. Without calibration, those rankings are meaningless.",
      "meaning_vi": "B: Điện thoại có cài độ nhạy khác nhau nên xếp hạng tiếng ồn sai.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "evidence"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T05",
      "speaker_id": "A",
      "text_en": "An empty Sunday bus and a crowded weekday bus are not fair alternatives. Compare similar routes at comparable times and document traffic conditions.",
      "meaning_vi": "A: Nên so các chuyến tương tự vào thời gian tương đương.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "evidence"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T06",
      "speaker_id": "C",
      "text_en": "The bus recordings contain sudden braking noises, while cycling recordings include wind buffeting the microphone. We need to identify environmental sounds and recording artefacts separately.",
      "meaning_vi": "C: Tiếng phanh và gió đập micro cần được phân biệt với mức ồn môi trường.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "critical_discussion"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T07",
      "speaker_id": "B",
      "text_en": "This also makes it clear why personal impressions should not be converted into a decibel value.",
      "meaning_vi": "B: Cảm giác cá nhân không thể tự chuyển thành giá trị decibel.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "peer_response"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T08",
      "speaker_id": "C",
      "text_en": "A whole-trip average can conceal a short but intense burst from a passing vehicle. We should report those peaks separately without claiming they cause injury.",
      "meaning_vi": "C: Mức trung bình có thể che các đỉnh âm lớn trong thời gian ngắn.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "evidence"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T09",
      "speaker_id": "B",
      "text_en": "Rather than ask commuters to guess how loud a trip felt, we will carry the same calibrated sound meter on each selected route and keep its position consistent.",
      "meaning_vi": "B: Dùng cùng máy đo đã hiệu chuẩn ở vị trí cố định trên các tuyến.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "evidence"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T10",
      "speaker_id": "A",
      "text_en": "Make sure the risk language in the introduction is proportionate to what you actually measured.",
      "meaning_vi": "A: Ngôn ngữ về nguy cơ phải vừa với điều thực sự đo.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "peer_response"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T11",
      "speaker_id": "A",
      "text_en": "We only sampled a few routes near campus. The report can compare those journeys; it must not present the findings as national exposure levels or medical evidence.",
      "meaning_vi": "A: Chỉ diễn giải là so sánh nhỏ theo tuyến gần trường.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "evidence"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T12",
      "speaker_id": "B",
      "text_en": "Keep the original phone recordings as exploratory material, clearly noting their incompatible automatic gain settings.",
      "meaning_vi": "B: Giữ bản ghi điện thoại làm thăm dò và ghi rõ cài đặt khác nhau.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "evidence"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T13",
      "speaker_id": "A",
      "text_en": "If the calibrated meter shows a very short peak, make the time scale visible. The average and the peak answer different questions about what the commuter experiences.",
      "meaning_vi": "A: Phải làm rõ thang thời gian của đỉnh âm; mức trung bình và đỉnh đo hai điều khác nhau.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
        "evidence_evaluation"
      ],
      "bank_role": "protected_assessment",
      "discourse_role": "critical_discussion"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "T14",
      "speaker_id": "C",
      "text_en": "The calibrated meter logs from matched journeys will form our main analysis.",
      "meaning_vi": "C: Nhật ký máy đo hiệu chuẩn là dữ liệu phân tích chính.",
      "translation_vi": null,
      "translation_status": "pending_full_sentence_human_translation",
      "start_ms": null,
      "end_ms": null,
      "skill_tags": [
        "part3_opinion_tracking",
        "paraphrase",
